800+ Presentations at Intl. Conf. on Environmental Science/Technology 

-       Early Registration 
 
The International Conference on Environmental Science and Technology
<http://www.aasci.org/conference/env/2012/index.html>  2012 will be held on
June 25-29, 2012 in Houston, Texas, USA. It is sponsored and organized by
the American Academy of Sciences. The technical program is expected to have
more than 800 platform and poster presentations.
 
Presentation schedule with presentation tiles can be downloaded from the
conference web site at 
 
http://www.aasci.org/conference/env/2012/ICEST2012-conference-schedule.pdf
 
Online Registration:
http://www.aasci.org/conference/env/2012/registration.html
Offline Registration:
http://www.aasci.org/conference/env/2012/registrationform2012.pdf
 
Contact information: ICEST2012, Environmental Conference Program, American
Academy of Sciences, 9720 Town Park Dr., Ste 18, Houston, TX 77036, USA
Phone:713-776-8846; Fax: 713-776-9767
Email: env-conference@AASci.org
Website: http://www.aasci.org/conference/env/2012/index.html
 
 
 

